Z||000003||maryjane||11-03-2001||02:39 PM||||and what about the insects that starved from not having tree sap to suck, the wasteful energy expended in popping that much popcorn,<BR>all the water wasted in making the mud (or the tiny organisims that normally lived in that mud- now deceased), and all the clams that forfieted their lives, or are now scooting around naked because of shell shock?<BR>What's PC about that? Have you no decency or respect? What heartless bast***s these hammy-Americans must be!!||||reg||1
